    "causal_summary": "Plan the home session list's interaction and state machine from the verified orca synthesis: recency-sort the roster by updatedAt (1.1), pull-to-refresh that keeps the last-good snapshot on failure (1.2), a four-kind list state machine — loading · error+retry · host-too-old · ready — that keeps old data on refetch (1.9), a reserved resume slot filled from cache and inert until live (1.10), single-flight Open that disables every open while one launch is in flight (1.11), and the five-way haptics taxonomy (1.12).",
